  "en": {
    "title": "assoc - Show which app open(1) will pick",
    "synopsis": "assoc [extension]",
    "description": "Prints the file-association table, or the single entry for one extension, plus the fallback used when nothing matches.",
    "details": "NAME\n  assoc - Show which app open(1) will pick\n\nSYNOPSIS\n  assoc [extension]\n\nDESCRIPTION\n  Prints the file-association table, or the single entry for one extension, plus the fallback used when nothing matches.\n\nOPTIONS\n  [extension]\n    Just this extension, with or without the dot.\n\nDEVICE COST\n  One GET /api/associations.\n\nSEE ALSO\n  open(1), apps(1)\n\nEXAMPLES\n  assoc\n  assoc txt\n  assoc | grep notepad"
  }
